{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  task 0006 (Task 2) — Community Page, social link-out cards (chosen over the photo-gallery
  concept)
  ============================================================================
  DXB confirmed: replace the original photo-gallery concept entirely — production's 12 gallery
  photos were generic Pexels stock filler for an idea never actually implemented (captions like
  "Morning wellness routine with Flora Bella" paired with anonymous stock photos of unrelated
  people, no real customer-submitted content, no real gallery backend). This section replaces
  that with cards linking out to Flora Bella's real, live social profiles instead — same
  "explore the community" intent, backed by something real.

  WHY CUSTOM CODE (not hand-assembled native blocks): a fully native version IS possible — a
  Section with N native Group blocks (each with its own `link`/`open_in_new_tab` settings) and
  a native Icon block (Horizon's built-in icon set already includes facebook/instagram/youtube/
  linkedin/tiktok — confirmed in blocks/_accordion-row.liquid's icon options) would work with
  zero custom code. This custom version exists instead because a one-click "Custom" preset that
  auto-populates with the real production social URLs (see 0006_task2_howto.md) is faster and
  lower-risk for DXB to drop in than hand-configuring several separate native Group blocks'
  link/icon settings individually — same tradeoff already made for every other "Custom" section
  preset in this project. It still REUSES the theme's own native icon rendering rather than
  hand-drawing social icons — see blocks/bfbella-social-card.liquid's own comment.

  WHAT THIS FILE NEEDS ALONGSIDE IT:
    - blocks/bfbella-social-card.liquid
  Each card renders itself entirely — this section only does `{% content_for 'blocks' %}`.

  CONTENT: zero real copy hardcoded — heading, subheading, and every card's platform/URL/handle
  are blank native settings/block fields until filled in via templates/page.community.json or
  the theme editor. See 0006_task2_howto.md for production's actual, real social URLs (fetched
  directly from the live site's footer, not guessed).

  COLOR: no hardcoded hex. Accent resolves through `section.settings.accent_color`, falling
  back to `color_palette.color3`. Background resolves through
  `section.settings.background_color`, falling back to `settings.color_palette.background`.

  DEPLOY: written directly into this live repo's working tree as part of the 2026-09-07
  live-edit pilot (see claude_docs/build_docs/live_edit_pilot_plan.md) — DXB reviews, then
  commits and pushes by hand.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign accent = section.settings.accent_color | default: settings.color_palette.color3
  assign bg = section.settings.background_color | default: settings.color_palette.background

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id, skip_contrast: true
  endif
%}

<div
  id="CommunitySocial-{{ section.id }}"
  class="bfbella-community-social{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
  style="
    --bfbella-accent: {{ accent }};
    --bfbella-bg: {{ bg }};
    {% if section.settings.padding_top != blank %}--bfbella-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.padding_bottom != blank %}--bfbella-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;{% endif %}
  "
>
  <div class="bfbella-community-social__inner page-width">

    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
      <div class="bfbella-community-social__intro">
        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="bfbella-community-social__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
          <p class="bfbella-community-social__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="bfbella-community-social__grid">
        {% content_for 'blocks' %}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bfbella-community-social {
    position: relative;
    padding-block-start: var(--bfbella-pad-top, 3rem);
    padding-block-end: var(--bfbella-pad-bottom, 6rem);
    background-color: var(--bfbella-bg);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .bfbella-community-social__inner {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-community-social__intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-block-end: 3rem;
  }

  .bfbella-community-social__heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-block-end: 0.75rem;
  }

  .bfbella-community-social__subheading {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .bfbella-community-social__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;

    @media screen and (min-width: 600px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "BFBella — Social Links",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "bfbella-social-card"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "Accent color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Used for the icon badges. Leave blank to use the theme's existing color3 (brand green) swatch."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 96
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "BFBella — Social Links",
      "category": "Custom",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "bfbella-social-card", "settings": { "platform": "instagram" } },
        { "type": "bfbella-social-card", "settings": { "platform": "facebook" } },
        { "type": "bfbella-social-card", "settings": { "platform": "youtube" } },
        { "type": "bfbella-social-card", "settings": { "platform": "linkedin" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
